From fa251f119cdbcf74fc876f9757684b53fc7b56cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MY <malaysianblogger@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 21:54:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: treat Google's bare 429 (grounding) as a standing limit,
 not a per-minute one

Live diagnose showed googleSearch grounding returns RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED with only a help link on every model.
New reason quota_unspecified: not retried on the same model, one sibling failover, accurate message.
Record the measured latency findings in DIAGNOSIS.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YY6Sfykqo2vVWa21WxtgPg
